   "gap_before": 0.78,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Definitely bedding, or at least a sheet and duvet. Making the bed at midnight from a random box is no fun.",
