   "gap_before": 1.45,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Yes to all three, plus tea or coffee. And a few basic tools like scissors and a screwdriver.",
